        "chars": 359,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 6.67
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        327,
        2135,
        1881,
        2735
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I hereby further authorize and direct that each employee of the City of New York who engages in voluntary or ordered military duty be granted pay for accrued vacation running from the time of his last vacation to the date of inception of military service. Such vacation pay allowance shall not exceed the regular vacation period granted such employees by your department for a full year's service, but in no instance shall such allowance exceed thirty days.",
